FLIGHT EVALUATION OF A DISPLAY FOR STEEP APPROACH
By R. Earl Dunham, Jr., Jack J. Hatfield,
Henry C. Elkins, and Richard H. Sawyer
Langley Research Center
INTRODUCTION
Since the last conference on operating problems (ref. 1) NASA has conducted and
reported on studies of steep instrument approaches with 11 airplanes:
Commercial transports

Business

C-47
DC-8
880
990
707 -320

Learjet

720
727

Military
