F-8C
Research
367-80

All the airplanes except the C-47 were turbine-powered, and all except the Boeing 367 -80
research airplane were tested with conventional in"
ntrs:19710021280,ntrs,"NASA Aircraft Safety and Operating Problems, Volume 1",,96,"-320

Learjet

