This has been a status"
ntrs:19710021280,ntrs,"NASA Aircraft Safety and Operating Problems, Volume 1",,162,"The patchiness for all disturbances was rated ""about right."" All the pilots were bothered by the
lack of lateral motions which are normally associated with turbulence.

