must meet the flammability requirements of flight
equipment.
For flight equipment, figure 8 shows tw"
ntrs:19720020916,ntrs,Systematic control of nonmetallic materials for improved fire safety,,11,"ssurized with oxygen, and personnel are in the
cabin, the materials used in the nonflight equipment
must meet the flammability requirements of flight
