FIRESAFETY DESIGN OF A MOBILE QUARANTINE FACILITY
By Roderick S. Bass and John K. Hirasaki
NASA Manned Spacecraft Center

ABSTRACT

This paper is a discussion of the approach taken"
ntrs:19730064278,ntrs,Proceedings of the NASA Conference on Materials for Improved Fire Safety,,163,"d)
