gas, ( b ) abnormal l u n g f u n c t i o n , o r ( c ) s h u n t i n g o f venous b l o o d i n t o
a r t e r i a l stream.
I R R I T A N T - a gas t h a t i n f l a m e s t i s s u e s by d i r e c t c o n t a c t , o r d i n a r i l y t h e
s u r f a c e s o f s k i n and mucous membranes.
