be found i s a h a b i t a t i o n module. T h i s module w i l l c o n t a i n t h e l i v i n g space
f o r t h e crew. The crewmembers w i l l p r e p a r e and e a t t h e i r meals i n t h e h a b i t a t i o n module. F a c i l i t i e s f o r p e r s o n a l hygiene and r e c r e a t i o n and e x e r c i s e w i l l
p r o b a b l y be found i n t h e h a b i t a t i o n module. Space t o s t o r e t h e p e r s o n a l
b e l o n g i n g s o f t h e crew and s u p p l i e s necessary f o r d i n i n g w i l l be found h e r e .

A second k i n d o f module occupancy t h a t w i l l be t y p i c a l l y found i n space
s t a t i o n s i s one o r more l a b o r a t o r y modules. The purpose o f space s t a t i o n s ,
t h e advancement o f s c i e n c e and technology, w i l l r e q u i r e e x t e n s i v e f a c i l i t i e s
t o p e r f o r m experiments o f many types i n t h e m i c r o g r a v i t y o f space. A s w i t h
l a b o r a t o r y f a c i l i t i e s on e a r t h , t h e r e w i l l be hazardous processes and chemic a l s used j n l a b o r a t o r i e s on space s t a t i o n s , and t h e p r o b a b i l i t y f o r mishaps
t o occur i s a p p r e c i a b l e . L a b o r a t o r i e s w i l l r e q u i r e c a r e f u l d e s i g n and c o n t r o l
t o achieve safe operations.

