F i g u r e 1 i n d i c a t e s a p o s s i b l e arrangement o f t h e NASA Space S t a t i o n
modules. The modules i n t h i s f i g u r e a r e connected t o g e t h e r by nodes and t u n n e l s . Two o f t h e modules a r e connected t o g e t h e r i n a c i r c u l a r arrangement,
w i t h t h e o t h e r two a t t a c h e d t o t h i s c i r c u l a r t r a c k .
