used this model to study premixed

laminar flames in rich and lean hydrogen-oxygen mixtures

diluted with nitrogen. The resultr of them simulations are discussed in terms of current theories of flame stability and the formation of cellular structures. The validity of two prominent
theories of cellular instability is investigated.
Early experimental observations showed that cellular flames occur in lean hydrogen-air
