A new timedependent two-dimendonal model haa been uaed to study the stability of rich
and lean premixed laminar hydrogen-oxygen flamea diluted with nitrogen. The model included
a detailed chemical reaction scheme consisting of 24 reveraible reactions among eight species,

thermal conductivity, and the individual species diffusion velocities. Four t a t s were presented
which showed the evolution of perturbed two-dimensional flames:
