protein crystals from solution in
space
Importance: By analyzing protein
crystals, scientists may be able to
develop dramatically better medical
and agricultural products. To
improve the quality of protein crystals grown in space, more information is needed about optimum
mixing times, solution concentrations, and other growth parameters.

