Spacelab module. The U.S. Microgravity Payload (USMP), an unpressurized
system in the Shuttle payload bay is to be first flown in October 1992. These
Spacelab missions form a foundation for future microgravity research on
space Station Freedom. This research will continue as Shuttle and

