METALS COMBUSTION IN NORMAL GRAVITY AND MICROGRAVITY
Theodore A. Steinberg and D. Bruce Wilson
Lockheed-ESC
White Sands Test Facility, New Mexico
and
Frank J . Benz
NASA
White Sands Test Facility, New Mexico

Introduction a nd backgr ound"
ntrs:19930010989,ntrs,The Second International Microgravity Combustion Workshop,,241,"MICROGRAVITY
Theodore A. Steinberg and D. Bruce Wilson
Lockheed-ESC
White Sands Test Facility, New Mexico
and
