that many more than two radicals are destroyed for each heptane molecule consumed, but further
chemical studies are needed to determine how many.
Future Plans
It is pla.nned to investigate the fuel chemistry further, in an effort to determine better t he values of
the parameters a,{3, and 'Y. It is also planned to initiate similar asymptotic analyses for alcohol fuel
droplets. Finally, microgravity experiments on alkane droplet extinction in different atmospheres
are planned, to test predictions.
