High pressure low temperature vaporizatIOn experiments
Preliminary e~:periments have been conducted under normal gravity conditions to determine the influence of
ambient pressure on the vaporization of n-heptane and methanol droplets in air at 300 K (or Tr = Trrc = 0.56
