13. ABSTRACT (Maximum 200 words)

This CP contains 40 papers prese nted at the Second International Microgravity Combustion Workshop held in Cltvcland,
Ohio from September 15 to 17, 1992. The purpose of the workshop was twofold: to exchange information about th e
progress and promise of combustion science in microgravity and to provide a forum to discuss which areas in
microgravity combustion science need to be expanded profitably and which should be included in upcoming NASA
Research Announcements (NRA).

