and retrieving
orbiting satellites
and space probes. For practical and economic reasons, the inclusion
of all space
activities
into the human-crew
STS has not occurred.
Currently,
world-wide launch operations
use
non-crewed
expendable
launch vehicles (ELV), and the U.S. retains a mix of the STS and ELV space
transportation.
