implied significant sideflow in both Ig and J..Lg . This has not been revealed by line-of-sight , refractive index
methods to date or by the shape of the visible flame front. Furthermore, these 3D spanwise effects cannot
be predicted by current 2D numerical models. Secondly, symmetrical processes were found in Ig but not in
