Perform soot volume fraction/temperature measurements under normal-gravity for test conditions outlined in section 2.
Incorporate optical diagnostic apparatus on the droplet combustion apparatus (that is being built at NASA-LeRC) for use
in 2.2 sec cIroptower and aboard the DC-9. Reduced-gravity droplet combustion experiments for soot volume fraction and
temperature measurements are scheduled for mid-summer, 1995.
