7. CONCLUSIONS
Recent studies using sophisticated transient numeri-

cal models which consider detailed chemistry and transport have led to new and exciting discoveries in the·field
of droplet combustion. Refinement of chemical kinetic,
equilibrium, and transport sub-models continues along
with the development of a new 2-D axi-symmetric droplet combustion model.

