Typical E values expected are in the range 0.01 - 0.1, and these values evidently are applicable in Fig. (9). It is nO(ed that similar comparisons
of experiment and theory have been published for he~tanelhexadecane droplets that were burned in reduced-gravity at supercritical pressures
though for a limited range of gas-phase compositions 1 ; we will compare our results with Ihese data shot1ly.
