Results and Discussion
System 1: Nil Al
Combusti"
ntrs:19960008386,ntrs,The 3rd International Microgravity Combustion Workshop,,200,"ng scanning electron microscopy (SEM) along with energy dispersive X-ray
spectrometry (EDX).
