and subsequent parameter estimation of complete spectra, either in the form of Fourier spectra or temporal
autocorrelation functions. Processors of this type have yielded a ten-fold improvement in the accuracy of the
resulting velocity estimates, and are able to operate at lower overall signal to noise ratios.s A system of this type
is being utilized in microgravity combustion science research at the Lewis Research Center, and provides several

