THREE-DIMENSIONAL FLOW IN A
MICROGRAVITY DIFFUSION FLAME
Jean Hertzberg
Center for Combustion Research
Department of Mechanical Engineering
University of Colorado at Boulder
Mark Linne
Division of Engineering
