used to construct an approximation for the divergence of the radiative heat flux.
Utilizing a modified hydrogen-air reaction mechanism [13] with the transport model
employed in [12], we computed flame balls as a function of the equivalence ratio </>. Temperature and radii results are compared with our original computations in Figures 1a and
