changes, there is a modest increase of the rich flammability limit with the new mechanism.
Only very small changes occur on the lean side but they move in the direction of increased
agreement with the experiments [12]. In Figures 1b and 1d we compare the temperature
and radii as a function of the equivalence ratio for the new mechanism/old transport calculations with calculations made with the new mechanism and the transport and radiation
models discussed above. Essentially no major differences were found. Nevertheless, due to
its more accurate formulation, the detailed transport and band radiation models will be
utilized in all future flame ball calculations.·

