Two experiments
are conducted simultaneously
during the approximately
6 minute experiment.
The mirror twin flow tunnels support from 1-20 crrds flow through each tunnel with 10 cm x 10 cm flow crossection.
Black
PMMA samples, 2 cm long x 2 cm thick x 0.635 cm wide, are mounted in the floor of the duct 4 cm from the inlet flow
straighteners.

