per PI experiment.
Also, the upmass (mass that is
launched
to ISS) per PI will need to be less than
75 kg.
This is significantly
less
than
past
experiments
developed
for use in prior pressurized
science
carriers such as Spacelab
and Spacehab.
FCF developers
