common 28 VDC power bus. If an ISS bus failure,
or some other
failure occurs, the EPCU will shed
only the required load necessary
to remain below
assigned
bus power
allocations.
Load
sharing
between
the two ISS power buses offer greater
power
management
and
scheduling
flexibility.
Based on science mission objectives,
priorities
can
be assigned to each load connected
to the EPCU.

