ground controls were carried out for the free interface diffusion reactors since the method functions quite
differently in a environment. Following the missions. the dialysis cells were returned to Strasbourg for
analysis and the free interface diffusion cells to Riverside. They were, in both cases, immediately examined and photographed, and x-ray diffraction analysis was initiated.

