In reference 11, numerical solutions of the equations determining the equilibrium free surface are
depicted for some canonical proboscis-containers. Although the liquid rise in the corner is not discontinuous as occurs for a planar wedge, it can be ""nearly discontinuous"" in that the rise height in the proboscis is
