the shift can be easily observed for a broad ran ge of yo. Through proper choice of the domain parameters
for the cases considered, an effective balance can be obtained between conflicting requirements of a sharp
near discontinuity (for accurate measurement) and a sizable volume of liquid rise (for ease of observation).
