a kinematic viscosity of about 180 mm'/sec for air at the arithmetic mean (1280 K) of the vaporization and
flame temperatures, the value of C is 0.4. This value is higher than the previous results obtained for n-heptane
droplets with smaller initial diameters (< 1.5 mm), Z1 but similar to the observations of Gokalp et a1. 30 for
pure vaporization.
