calibration subsystem, and a microprocessor which is used for in-flight experiment control, processing, and storage of flight data [I-41. The acceleration sensor's output signal is filtered using a
Bessel filter with a cut off frequency of 1 Hz. The output signal is digitized at 10 samples per
