Filling experiments have been conducted with 0 to 35% preform (i.e., stacked layers of chopped
glass fiber mats) placed in the cavity. Channeling and gravity are measured to have notable
effects on th"
ntrs:19990040241,ntrs,NASA Microgravity Materials Science Conference,,32,"Filling experiments have been conducted with 0 to 35% preform (i.e., stacked layers of chopped
glass fiber mats) placed in the cavity. Channeling and gravity are measured to have notable
