(ii) Modified Unit-Cell Model
We have developed a modified unit-cell model for predicting the internal solid fraction
evolution in equiaxed dendritic solidification. Such unit-cell models can be used as rnicromodels in simulations of casting processes. While the original model for a single crystal was
recently verified using data from the IDGE (Figure 3a) [2] , the modified model is designed for
an assemblage of multiple crystals and will be validated using EDSE data. As shown in Figure
3b, it predicts a transient variation in the tip speeds, as well as a transition from a fully dendritic
structure to a more globulitic structure with increasing thermal interaction.

