Combustion Synthesis of Titanium Nitride under Fluidization
Kenneth Brezinsky, Principal Investigator
(kenbrez@uic.edu, 312-996-943 0)
and
Kyeong-Ook"
ntrs:19990040241,ntrs,NASA Microgravity Materials Science Conference,,107,"averaged particle size and self diffusivity.

