We use the asymptotic relationships given in [24J to select the parameters in Eqs. (1) such that it
operates in the sharp interface limit, defined by U at the interface satisfying Uint = -d(r1)K.-/3(r1)Vn .
The variable d(r1) is the capillary length, K. is the local curvature, (3(r1) is the interface attachment
