Reactions and Surface Transformations of a Bone-Bioactive
Material in a Simulated Microgravity Environment
S. Radin I , P. Ducheyne I, and P.S. Ayyaswaml
Center for Bioactive Material s and Tissue Engineering
University of Pennsylvania
Philadelphia, PA 19104-6315
Department of Bioengineering
School of Engineering and Applied Sciences
