SYNTHESIS OF SEMICONDUCTOR AND METAL OXIDE NANOPARTICLES BY
LASER VAPORIZATION-CONTROLLED CONDENSATION TECHNIQUES

M . Samy EI-Shall
Department of Chemistry
Virginia Commonwealth University
Richmond, VA 23284-2006
Phone: (804) 828-3518; Fa"
