SUMMARY AND CONCLUSIONS
(1) Serial sectioning and image processing techniques are established to recreate large volume
high-resolution three-dimensional microstructure of tungsten heavy alloys .
(2) Combination of serial sections , reconstructed three-dimensional microstructure and
stereological methods
permit unbiased and assumption-free estimation of following
