conjunction with the bottom rod is a vibrator that operates at a frequency of 70 Hertz and
oscillation amplitude of - 1OO~m. The induced surface streaming flow, due to end-wall vibration
of the float-zone, counteracts the thermocapillary flow which results in a balance, Figure 1
