The overall approach in the proposed work is to first compare the existing model with recent
measurements of secondary neutron production. Second, the additional contributions to neutron
production described in the previous paragraph will be incorporated into the model and ultimately
be compared with the available data and with the data to be obtained in the experimental phase of
this program.
