data show a decreasing trend in the liquidus with increasing Nd to and including the composition
Y)Nd.9Ba2Cu30x. At that composition, the liquidus temperature reaches a minimum of 1500 °C
(± 25°C). For the pure Nd-1 :2:3 samples, the liquidus increases markedly to 1600 °C (± 25°C) .

