and raise it (up-quench). For each dendritic growth run we would record the dendritic
growth kinetics and morphology of the initial and final steady-states, and the transient
evolution of the transition connecting the two well-defined, dynamic st~tes. Figure 2
shows a picture that represents schematically what is described in the text.

