Crystal Growth of II-VI Semiconducting Alloys by Directional Solidification

Dr. Sandor L. Lehoczky, Principal Investigator
NASA Marshall Space Flight Center
Mail Code ES75
Marshall Space Flight Center, AL 35812
Phone: (256) 544-7758
