failed too low, which is a very common occurrence, the furnace power would increase and cause
the furnace to over heat. An automatic shutdown occurred when the monitoring thermocouples
exceeded the 1650 °C temperature limit and the sample was quenched, resulting in a 100%
science loss.

I
I

