fluid motion in the melt on the growth characteristics as well as the microstructure forme d in
the solid. In particular, we will study hydrodynamic effects during directional solidification,
coarsening, and dendritic growth, where complicated interface morphologies and flows may be
present. Finally we will extend the model to solidification of a binary alloy with fluid flow in
the melt.

