I

For growth, the ampoule was heated up within 15 minutes and kept at a constant temperature for
45 minutes to guarantee a homogeneous distribution of the dopant in the melt. The ampoule was
pulled down with a constant velocity of 0.5 mmlmin. No ampoule rotation was applied.

I

I
