uniform dispersions of anisotropic inorganic particles can be produced with templating methods
if the chemical interaction between the organic template and the 'particle is carefully controlled.
Our initial work has now lead to LB model studies of silver and gold particles at organic
templates. Silver particles are grown from silver nitrate solutions at monolayer templates formed
from negatively charged surfactants. Gold particles have been formed photochemically by
lo
