continuous film covering the crystals near the contact line. As such, we first analyze the geometry
of the solid/liquid interface underlying a semi-infinite thin film of solution. The structure observed
is reminiscent of morphological instabilities, but because the source of impurities lies across the
fIlm, the front evolution is essentially different, akin to an activated instability.
