The sample SLNF-423 was cut axially down the center line and polished mechanically with a
final chemo-mechanical polish with 2%bromine dissolved in ethylene glycol. Initial WDS results
are available at the time of writing, and are shown in figure 9.16. Four views are shown, namely
secondary electron imaging, CdL, TeL and HgM. Of these, the Cd and Te are WDS while the Hg
