and are not corrected for the physics effects as in WDS. Several important points can be made.
First of all, the narrowing of the CdTe seed can be seen. It had been dissolved in the acid.
Secondly, the interface shape is much improved over earlier tests. In this case the deflection
across the boule is about 0.3 mm, compared with 1.3 mm in sample SL1-424 (see figure 9.11).
There is confirmation of the surface results in that there is an obvious initial transient. The
