test in terms of ignition energy, means of edge ignition, direction of buoyancy-assisted
flame spread, sample thickness, and oxygen concentration.
Nevertheless,
the test models a fire scenario that has no counterpart
in low gravity. In fact, all practical spacecraft
flammability
