Species Profiles: The species profiles for the five stretch rates under examination are presented in
Figures 6-28 through 6-43. They are ordered by increasing stretch rate, and the species are grouped by
order of magnitude. Note changes in domain so that the full range of species profile is visible. The flame
temperat"
