The FCF/FIR systems are being designed to maximize
the amount
of science
that can be done on-orbit.
Experiments
will
be designed
and operated
to
efficiently progress through the test matricies.
This will
be through a combination
of highly automated systems,
on-orbit physical component
change-outs
or processing
by the crew,
and software
updates
