requiring sophisticated gas-blending and diagnostics

Ultimately, the combined capability of CIR and MSG
will allow the discipline to conduct 12 planned
investigations in the next 5 years (at a rate of 2.4
PI/year). It is anticipated that the utilization rate of
research after the initial 5 years will increase, as the
ISS will have entered its operational phase after
completing its assembly phase.

