Utilization of CIR
Presently, fourteen investigations have been selected to
conduct combustion science experiments in a logically
grouped fashion within the CIR utilizing four multiuser systems by 2011. Additional participation by
commercial and international partners will increase the
CIR utilization through conduct of at least four
additional investigations in that timeframe. It is
anticipated that future investigators will be selected
whose investigation will utilize existing multi-user
system capabilities.

