Bubble Agglomeration and Coalescence: Consider now the dynamics of bubbles in an

unmodulated ultrasonic field such that shape oscillations are not being driven. The primary effed of the
acoustic field is to cause an attraction to special locations in the standing wave as noted earlier. This
manifestation of the radiation force is sometimes referred to as the primary Bjerknes force.lOt11 As

ig

