CONCLUSIONS

With the examples given in Fig. 6 and Fig. 7, it is shown that the on-orbit a c c e l e m n
measurements confirmed the quality of the EURECA microgravity environment. Together
ground test results in Fig. 3, it can be said that EURECA performed better than specified in QJ. 1.
Many interesting findings could be evaluated from the on-orbit acceleration measurement HAJch
improves the understanding of on-orbit spacecraft system Performances and analytical simul-.
