as well as the design drawings once the team is selected.
The construction of the experiment apparatus can be
done by or with technology students. Science students
conduct 1 g ground tests with the experiment to prove
out operations and to gather baseline experiment data
with which to compare the data from microgravity tests.
Mentors are an important part of a team’s work in
