establish any clear pressure dependence of the boundary between radiant and diffusive extinction.
The data, as a whole, do reveal systematic dependences of burning-rate constants on conditions.
There are, however, some irregularities in the data, such as test 29, which showed an abnormally small
burning-rate constant. This may be due to failure to capture an appreciable portion of the history of this
