and McGill University under (NASA) Microgravity Combustion Science Grant NCC3-846. The
authors appreciate the helpful input from their grant advisor Dr. Peter Sunderland at NASA
Glenn. Thanks also to ISU undergraduate Joel Smeby for his shop skills.
