Urban Plant Potentiality for VOC Detoxification
IRENE I. PATALAKH
Dnipropetrovsk National University
13 Naukovii by-st.
Dnipropetrovsk, Ukraine 49625
Phone: 380-562-469280
Fax: 380-562-465523
