Numerical Modeling, Thermomechanical Testing, and NDE Procedures
for Prediction of Microcracking Induced Permeability of Cryogenic
Composites
Jae Noh, John Whitcomb *
Bongtaek Oh, Dimitris Lagoudas
Konstantin Maslov, Atul Ganpatye, Vikram Kinra
