High Temperature Thermographic Phosphor Coatings Development
SHAWN GOEDEKE
Department of Mechanical Engineering
Tennessee Technological University
Cookeville, TN 38505
Phone: 865-376-7595
E-mail: SMG2886@tntech.edu
S.W. Allison, D.L. Beshears, T. Bencic, M.R. Cates
