SUMMARY
In ti program, counterflow diffusion flames were studied for various fuels flowing
hs
a g w decomposition products from solid AP pellets in order to obtain fununderstanding of composite propellant flame structure and chemistry. Non-intrusive laser
diagnostics measurements were performed to measure a significant number of s a a s with
