The conclusion of this section of the work is that although coupled LRC RF
circuits evidence a splitting of the resonant frequency into as many branches as there are
coupled circuits no enhancement in energy storage capacity or improvement in Q occurs.
We have already seen that such enhancements and improvements do occur in the case of
coupled ring resonators1-3.
