rocket propulsion a phrase similar to “specific impulse is the thrust force per unit
propellant weight flow per second” will be found.(2) It is only after seeing the
mathematics written down does the definition mean something physically to scientists
and engineers responsible for either measuring it or using someone’s value for it. A
very typical mathematical definition is: (3)

