based on laboratory tests that were conducted using bolted trusses and other civil engineering
type structures for the most part. These are not the typical types of structures used in designing
and building NASA’s space vehicles and systems. It is therefore recommended that tests be
conducted using NASA type structures, such as pressure vessels, to validate the observations
made in this report.
