location-sensor type combination for which one sample was taken at each of the five pressure
levels. One trace (all five frequency ranges) at each level is one sample (see Figure1 for
example). Table 1 below summarizes the experiments. A consequence of the lack of multiple
samples is that statistical techniques may not be used to answer several of the questions.

