The camera has a one-third inch array with a pixel density of
768 by 484 pixels. The camera’s frame rate is settable up to
30 frames per second (fps) and shutter speed is settable from
1/60 of a second down to 1/10,000 of a second. In auto
shutter mode, shutter speeds down to 1/50,000 of a second
