vacuum resources and exhaust system, and provision
of gases. More details are provided in Table 1.
There is variety among the ISPR locations within
each module and among ISS modules with regard to
what specific interfaces are provided or available.
For example, the low temperature loop for thermal
control is only available in Destiny and Kibo.
