1990’s Extensive use of the Shuttle (middeck, SpaceLab and USMP)
Late 1990’s First Exploration research topics funded (FPDS, ISRU, ELS etc)
2004
VSE announced
2006
End of large scale Fundamental Research program
Transition to Exploration Program with 15% Non-Exploration
Research still funded

