The MSG is connected to the ISS Vacuum Resource, ISS Vacuum Exhaust, and GN2 subsy tems. The
experiment interface to these services is provided inside the WV. The vacuum resource/vent line may be used to
operate a furnace or achieve a course vacuum. The vacuum exhaust/waste gas system is u ed primarily for venting
