the locking mechanism. When the handle is removed, a complete flat surface is available for use inside the WV. An
oven-like concept is used inside the aifloek to allow for ease in payload transfer from the airlock to the WV. The
concept consists of a tray, which can be placed at two different heights or completely removed from the airlock. The
tray ts equipped with seven bungee cords for attaching payloads, The filter used in the airlock is the same type as
used in the WV. Power is not available for experiments inside the airlock. The temperature and humidity of the
Aifiock is monitored and is available in the MSG downlink data. Fig, 5 shows the location of the airlock on the
bottom right corner of the MSG work volume.
