Conclusions
•

Microgravity Combustion research has had significant impact on
the combustion discipline and can be expected to continue to
make strong contributions.

•

Research directions in spacecraft fire safety have promise to
significantly improve vehicle safety

•

The microgravity environment continues to be a critical resource
for improved understanding of combustion phenomena.

•

The combustion discipline has been very successful in utilizing
low gravity to advance the field and is anxious to seek further
opportunities.

