0.23

The Effect of Flow on Flame Spread in Microgravity
Numerical models and early drop tower experiments burning very thin fuel
samples demonstrated a U-shaped flammability boundary
Much of the boundary cannot be studied in 1-g because of the minimum
buoyant flow speed (~ 30 cm/s) present in every flame

