Figure 12.46."
ntrs:20205010965,ntrs,Training Materials and Best Practices for Chemical Weather/Air Quality Forecasting,,537,"uation was observed during the last days of June (Figure 12.46) when light and 
variable winds confined the remaining smoke close to the fire sources. 

 



