</p>
<p>where kλ is the"
ntrs:20240007877,ntrs,An Empirical Characterization of the Aerosol Angstrom Exponent Interpolation Bias using SAGE III/ISS Data,,4,"eit imprecise) indicator of effective particle size,
using the following equation (Ångström, 1929):
</p>
<p>kλ2
