14-µm SiC ﬁbers as suspending ﬁbers, in compari-
son with existing experimental results with 130-µm
quartz ﬁbers. This is due to smaller effects of the ﬁne
SiC ﬁber on the shape of the suspended droplet and
heat transfer.
