‘‘Cool Flames’’ – Two-stage combustion
Tanvir I. Farouk a,⇑, Frederick L. Dryer b
a Department of Mechanical Engineering, University of South Carolina, Columbia, SC 29208, United States
b Department of Mechanical and Aerospace Engineering, Princeton University, Princeton, NJ 08544, United States
a r t i c l e
