doi:10.1016/j.combustflame.2013.09.011,doi,Isolated n-heptane droplet combustion in microgravity: “Cool Flames” – Two-stage combustion,8,7,"sitivity of the droplet burning characteristics on the reaction rates
can be translated to ignition delay and oxidation speciation as well,
which are the commonly used combustion targets for model devel-
