Although this analytical model uses signiﬁcant simpliﬁcations 
and consequently has a limited quantitative predictability, it helps 
in understanding the present problem. The ﬁrst thing to note is 
that in normal Earth gravity it is not possible to observe forced- 
ﬂow ﬂame spread, because, in order to overcome gravity effects, 
the ﬂow velocity, U f , would have to be so large that the ﬂame 
would be extinguished by blow-off. In microgravity, as in the ex- 
