predicts the data in microgravity. As the pressure is reduced the resulting mixed flow velocity is also"
doi:10.1016/j.combustflame.2018.10.016,doi,Buoyancy effects on concurrent flame spread over thick PMMA,16,15,"16 
 
 
 
 
