C1 only depends on the sensor architecture (i.e. it is aerosol de-
pendent) and can be determined using a reference aerosol. CV2,
which expresses the scattered power per unit volume concentration,
is aerosol dependent. The determination of CV2 (or any Ci2, in general)
represents the core issue in designing and using an ensemble scat-
tering photometer. If P(d) and the index o"
