performed using a series of reference aerosols. The individual
channel outputs were recorded, while presenting the aerosols in
parallel to a TEOM and a Scanning Mobility Particle Spectrometer
(SMPS; TSI Model 3936). This allows the number, surface area, and
mass concentrations to be calculated, and input into the compu-
