regime where the Damk¨ohler pathway becomes more relevant, and 
extinction is reached when Da→Dacr. The corresponding limiting oxy­
gen concentration for fuel regression (LOC-FR) is therefore governed 
primarily by kinetics rather than transport, and it is lower than LOC-FS 
value.
