where EFi is the emission factor of species i in g per g of fuel consumed. CMFfuel is the carbon mass fraction of the fuel in g carbon per
g of fuel (Table S2). Ci is the concentration of species i in g/m3; CCO2 and CCO are the concentrations of CO2 and CO in g/m3,
