Fig. 6. TGA test (solid line) and GPYRO simulation 
(dashed line) results for SIBAL fabric in pure nitrogen 
at heating rate 10 °C/min. Main: Percentage of sample 
weight vs time. Inset: Mass loss rate (non-dimensionalized 
