ists outside the flame-spread limit from the Cluster 
H flame spreading from the left side of Fig. 3 . At 
t = 3.17 s, however, a relatively large initial flame 
forms around Droplet L through the ignition by 
the flame spreading from the right side, suggest- 
ing that Droplet L pre-vaporizes by heating from 
the Cluster H flame and a relatively large amount"
