shown in Fig. 3. The wave reaches a steady state at about 150 s (35 cm
using 0.23 cm/s spread rate). The inset to Fig. 8 shows steady state wave
profile in smolder-onset fixed coordinates. The steady wave only reaches
a maximum area of 2–2.5 cm2 in contrast with Fig. 7 which was double
