Appendix A. Representative flame leading-edge tracking
Representative plots of the flame leading-edge position as a function 
of time are presented in Fig. A1 for both 2D and flamelet spread modes. 
In both cases, a clear linear relationship is observed, indicating quasi- 
steady flame spread. For the flamelet mode, despite its zigzag propa­
gation, the leading edge exhibits an approximately constant spread rate.
