opposed flame spread over PMMA Rods
Jose Rivera a,*
, Christina Liveretou a, Carlos Fernandez-Pello a
, Michael J. Gollner a,  
Sandra Olson b
, Paul Ferkul b
, Dennis Stocker b
a Department of Mechanical Engineering, University of California, Berkeley, CA, 94720, USA
