at low oxygen and a weaker dependence at 
higher oxygen levels (h,_Q0:5Þ. This behavior is typical of a jet diffusion flame in 
laminar and turbulent regimes.
The experimental data from the present work will be useful in validating the existing 
computational and analytical models. Making thin cast PMMA rods is challenging, 
however, flame spread experiments on thin PMMA rods of diameter <0.5 mm 
PMMA rods and which resembles several common fibrous materials like human 
hair, fabrics etc. would be useful to assess their fire hazard. In addition, further 
research is also required to examine the variation of Limiting Oxygen Index with 
fuel diameter.
