observe the appearance of the flame. 
The present study attempts to simulate horizontal flame spread over a thin fuel in 
normal and elevated gravity regime. Our aim is to study the detail structures for 
horizontal flame spread in normal gravity to depict the controlling mechanism for such 
flame, and to investigate the influence on horizontal spreading flame by changing the 
y-level in elevated gravity regime. 
