V. Malhotra et al.
The present model (which incorporates calibrated reaction and fuel pyrolysis kinetics) has
been extensively validated with the experiments of Olson [8] of opposed ﬂow ﬂame spread
in normal gravity and microgravity and are reported in [11]. The predictions of the present
numerical model in partial gravity are also presented in Appendix 1. The comparison of
these predictions with related experiments and previous numerical models is also made.
The governing equations written in non-dimensional form and the boundary conditions
