The one-dimensional studies of Bedir et al. [24] and Rhatigan et al. [25] have shown that
even ﬂames as thin as one or two centimetres are not optically thin. Therefore, to improve
Downloaded by [University of Connecticut] at 04:36 24 July 2013"
