The governing equations are solved in a ﬂame-ﬁxed coordinate system in the numerical
model. Hence, the solid moves into the ﬂame at a rate equal to the ﬂame spread rate. There-
fore, the velocity proﬁle plotted in the upstream of the ﬂame at X: 0.75 cm is equivalent to
the order of

