A three-dimensional model of steady ﬂame spread
over a thin solid in low-speed concurrent ﬂows
Hsin-Yi Shih1 and James S T’ien2,3
1 Center for Aerospace and Systems Technology, Industrial Technology Research Institute,
Hsinchu, Taiwan 31040, Republic of China
