in understanding the three-dimensional ﬂame structure, the ﬂow ﬁeld and the spreading
characteristics. The ﬂame under the conditions of 15% oxygen and 5 cm s−1 inﬂow velocity
in the tunnel of 4 cm width are chosen since this case has been analysed in detail in previous
two-dimensional works [14, 15, 18]. Note that in this case, no inert strip is included, so the
width of the solid fuel is also 4 cm, the same as that of the tunnel.
