It would be useful to extend this research. For 
example, a Hough transform might be employed 
to rapidly determine approximate coordinates of 
the droplet edge, with further analyses then used 
to refine the droplet edge coordinates. It would 
also be of interest to consider the effects of strong 
sooting on diffraction, partial coherence, and 
determining the locations of droplet edges. 
