the WV. In this mode the WV will maintain a pressure differential of at 
least 1.3 mbar between the WV and the outside. When MSG is operating in 
Sealed mode, the process control valve outlets are sealed off, the fans are 
off, and no unfiltered air can leave the WV. This mode is also used for 
experiments not requiring air circulation in the WV. 
