The SOD1 hardware is being designed by the European Space Agency (ESA) to operate in the MSG facility and 
accommodate the Diffusion and Soret Coefficients (DSC) measurement investigation, the Influence of Vibration on 
Diffusion in Liquids (IVIDIL) investigation, and the Aggregation of Colloidal Solutions (COLLOID) investigation. 
