Space Station to perform this type of research. Much of the work needed to advance key technologies is already 
underway. In fact, many of the papers published at the 45th AIAA Aerospace Sciences Meeting and Exhibit in 
January 2007, involve analytical techniques and technologies that could possibly benefit from performing 
experiments in the MSG facility in the reduced gravity environment of the ISS. The authors of this paper wish to 
encourage all Scientist and Engineers who are performing research in the Space environment to make an 
investigation in the MSG facility a part of their development plan. 
