A. Effect of Flow Velocity 
Figure 4 shows the flame 
spread rate as a function of 
relative velocity between the 
flame and the forced flow.  For 
an opposed oxidizer flow, the 
relative velocity is the opposed 
flow velocity plus the flame 
spread rate.  It was found in [10] 
