Particle Morphology and Size Results from the Smoke 
Aerosol Measurement Experiment-2 
David L. Urban1, Gary A. Ruff2, Paul S. Greenberg3, David Fischer4, Marit Meyer5 
NASA Glenn Research Center, Cleveland, Ohio 44135 
