Soot Formation in Spherical Diffusion Flames
Sergey M. Frolov 1,*
, Vladislav S. Ivanov 1, Fedor S. Frolov 1, Pavel A. Vlasov 1, Richard Axelbaum 2,
Phillip H. Irace 3, Grigoriy Yablonsky 4
and Kendyl Waddell 5
